    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">一個微小的益處反映出你那出人意料的好運。你獲得</span><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.feats-all.Item.Zxh8VEiQwezfcnvk\" data-id=\"Zxh8VEiQwezfcnvk\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.feats-all\" data-tooltip=\"特性 物品\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;cursor:pointer;background:rgb(221, 221, 221);padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-dark-tertiary);border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:Signika, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">幸運</a><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">，</span><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.feats-all.Item.MhLJXPly0B8FEuFW\" data-id=\"MhLJXPly0B8FEuFW\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.feats-all\" data-tooltip=\"特性 物品\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;cursor:pointer;background:rgb(221, 221, 221);padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-dark-tertiary);border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:Signika, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">魔法學徒</a><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">，或者</span><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.feats-all.Item.sYRjltuR7nYyIMOg\" data-id=\"sYRjltuR7nYyIMOg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.feats-all\" data-tooltip=\"特性 物品\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;cursor:pointer;background:rgb(221, 221, 221);padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-dark-tertiary);border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:Signika, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">熟習</a><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">專長（由你選擇）。你所選擇的專長即反映了改變了你生活的變化。與某位給予你三個願望的巨靈的邂逅可能導致了由魔法學徒專長所展現的魔法力量。如果你以一次偶然的三龍牌局償清了你所有的家庭債務，則可能代之以幸運專長。要不然就是，你可以用熟習專長來反映出你爲爭取到嶄新命運，以及塑造由改變了你生活的力量所賜予的知識與能力而經受的各種考驗。</span></p>",
